  "id": "cherry-chicken-salad",
  "name": "Cherry Chicken Salad",
  "subtitle": "A cool, lightly sweet salad with crunchy pecans and fresh apple.",
  "description": "Combine cooked chicken with cherries, celery, pecans, and apple, then coat with a seasoned mayonnaise-buttermilk dressing and chill before serving.",
